type enlng
show 2 to the power of 100
show 9223372036854775807 plus 1
show -9223372036854775807 - 1 - 1
show 0 minus 9223372036854775807 minus 1
remember f as 1
for i from 1 to 30:
    f = f times i
show f
show f divided by 1000000007, f mod 1000000007
show f divided by f, f minus f, (f plus 1) minus f
remember a as 123456789012345678901234567890
show a, a times a
show a divided by 98765432109876543210
show a mod 98765432109876543210
show -a divided by 7, -a mod 7
show a is greater than 5, a > a plus 1, a is a, a is a whole number, a is a number
show type_of(a), abs(-a), to_number("99999999999999999999999")
show a plus 0.5 is greater than 1e29
show sum([a, a, 1])
show f"big: {a}", "x" + a
show to_json([a])
show 3 to the power of 200
show (2 to the power of 64) divided by (2 to the power of 32)
show (-2) to the power of 63, (-2) to the power of 64
remember s as [a, 5, -a, 0]
sort s
show s
show -(-9223372036854775807 - 1)
remember m as {}
m[to_text(a)] = 1
show m
show 100000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 minus 1
show 0x7FFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
try:
    show 10 to the power of 2000000
on error as problem:
    show problem
try:
    show [1, 2][a]
on error as problem:
    show problem
